      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794847530327,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"ASP.NET\"\n    - ActiveX Server Pages (ASP)\n    - ASP.NET (Web Forms)\n    - ASP.NET MVC - open source! really good. \n        - ASP.NET Web Api \n.NET Core\n    - There is are two runtimes.\n        - one that allows you to run .net applications generally,\n        - the other allows web development.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"ASP.NET\"\n    - ActiveX Server Pages (ASP)\n    - ASP.NET (Web Forms)\n    - ASP.NET MVC - open source! really good. \n        - ASP.NET Web Api \n.NET Core\n    - There is are two runtimes.\n        - one that allows you to run .net applications generally,\n        - the other allows web development.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
